OL,3,GNEWSAStranded walkers rescued from
OL,4,Aseries of waterfalls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pair of Peak District walkers were
OL,7,Frescued after taking a wrong turn and
OL,8,Fending up trapped in a series of
OL,9,Fwaterfalls.
OL,11,FKinder Mountain Rescue Team was called
OL,12,Fto Crowden Clough near Kinder Scout at
OL,13,F16:30 BST on Wednesday, where two
OL,14,Fpeople had headed away from their
OL,15,Fplanned route on to steep ground, which
OL,16,Fled to Crowden Brook.
OL,18,FUnable to scramble back up and with
OL,19,Frecent rainfall leading to a lot of
OL,20,Fwater running through the brook, one of
OL,21,Fthe walkers became soaked, so the pair
OL,22,Fcalled for help.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
